## Working style for this folder

- Agenda lives in `agenda.md` — segment-tagged (Concept / Live-build / Exercise / Break)
  with timings. Update it if the running order changes; it's the source of truth for
  both slide structure and in-room pacing.
- Slide deck source HTML lives in `deck/`. The deck is published as a Claude artifact;
  keep the local copy in sync when the artifact is edited.
- No comments in any demo code beyond what's needed to teach the point live — the code
  itself is the teaching material.
